xh.requirements:
Ibhazhuli ye-12 (Isatifikethi seSikolo sePhakamileyo okanye isigqibo esilinganayo) kunye nediploma yomsebenzi webhalana evunyiweyo nokuba yisigqibo solawulo esikwi-NQF level 5 okanye esiphezulu esahambelana nemfuno yethoshi; Ukuba nobuchule bomsebenzi ongaphantsi kweminyaka elishumi elithandathu kwinkxaso yomsebenzi webhalana nolawulo okunikiwe kuqeqesho abalawuli/abaphathi abaphezulu.
Ulwazi ngokuvelisa oku kulandelayo: Izenzo-zomthetho, iinkqubo ezilawulayo, iinkqubo zolawulo nokuziphatha okusemthethweni ezichaphazela imisebenzi yemithetho;
Iinkqubo zolwazi ezinceda ekulawuleni ulwazi nolwazi ngoluhlu lomsebenzi;
Ulawulo lweprojekthi;
Amalungelo okusebenza kolunye ugcino;
Iinkqubo zokuthengwa nokubhaliswa kweenkonzo;
Uphuhliso lweenkqubo zolawulo, nokulawula, ukuqhathanisa nokuphonononga iinkqubo;
Iinkqubo zolawulo neziko zexesha lethu;
Iinkqubo, iinkqubo neendlela zesikhundla sabantu baseRiphablikhi;
Iindaba zelizwe jikelele nezommandla zepolitiki, ezoqoqosho nentlalo ezichaphazela urhulumente wephondo leWestern Cape;
Izikhokelo zomthetho, zomthetho nangokwamabala ezilawula isikhundla sabantu baseRiphablikhi yomzantsi Afrika;
Imali yomphakathi, abantu basebenzayo nokuLawula ingxoxo yabantu;
UMthetho woLawulo weeMali zoRhulumente, Iinkqubo zeNqowa leSizwe nasePhondo, ezinye iinkqubo zamafutha namalungelo abantu basebenzayo;
Ukusebenza kwePhondo nemisebenzi yamasebe ahambelana nayo;
Iinkqubo zorhulumente welanga namhlanje;
Umthetho wezeNgqalwa neZiko neenkqubo zolawulo lomsebenzi nokuqhathanisa ngokubhalisa ngokomsebenzi ngokubanzi.
Amakhono okusebenza oku kulandelayo: Ukubala; Ulwazi lokusebenza ngakwikhompyutha; Ulwazi lolwimi.

xh.duties:
Kuvelisa inkxaso yomsebenzi webhalana/okwamabhala ekuqaleni kulo mphathi;
Ukuvelisa inkxaso yolawulo kulo mphathi; Kuvelisa inkxaso kumphathi ngokumayelana neengqungqutha; Inkxaso kumphathi ngolawulo lovuzo lomphathi;
Ukufunda iinkqubo zorhulumente namasebe namanye amaxwebhu aqinisekisa ukuba usetyenziso lwayo luyiweqo Tel No: (021) 763 6204.
